w sneers at her. Its name is Avenger, Servant of an eighth class who never existed in the Fifth Holy Grail War. Their unlikely encounter signals that the battle is far from finished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shirou Emiya, aspiring champion of justice, steps onto the stage of the Holy Grail War once more. What fate awaits him beyond these four days of destiny?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MINIGAMES INCLUDED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump! Tiger&amp;Shorts Hanafuda Travel Journal EX (Excellion)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rise! Operation Super Space-Time Tiger&amp;Shorts Hanafuda</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump! Super Space-Time Tiger&amp;Shorts Hanafuda Travel Journal EX (Excellion)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tempest Illya's Castle ~Assault! Einzbern~</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Better Fortune Tohsaka Shrine</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Capsule Servant is not included in this release.</p>","developers":["TYPE-MOON","fuzz Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2396990/3f9699f3c1b9ac8519f89f46c1ab6f7db9e48fe8/header.jpg?t=1771568121","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9TYPE-MOON","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2396990/881436737/aab7c7cfa72cffbecefc6efe3a05c77d914d5f02/1753955948/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754114634",